# An arm operation (SYSTEM_MODEL §6). kind:
#   op          do the op pending for this arm (fasten: both arms send one; the first waits)
#   regrip      3 s; redraw grip and pose of the pending op
#   tool_change wear -> 0
#   defer       leave the pending op undone; the pallet moves on and comes back after a lap
# Cancelling an op goal that is waiting for its partner releases the handshake.
string kind
int32 part_id
int32 op_index
---
bool success
string message            # done | jam | partner jammed | cancelled | rejected: <why>
---
string state
float64 progress
